  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "\u0110inh Li\u1EC5n"
    Lines:
    - "Ti\u1EBFng reo h\xF2 c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Ng\xF4 d\u1EA7n y\u1EBFu \u0111i khi
      ng\xE0y n\u1ED1i ng\xE0y l\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EA1n, b\u1EC7nh ph\xE1t. Th\u1EF1c
      ch\u1EA5t, ch\xFAng k\xE9o \u0111\u1EBFn ch\u1EC9 c\u1ED1t l\u1EA5y con tin
      l\xE0m s\u1EE9c \xE9p, ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng d\xE1m li\u1EC1u m\xECnh c\xE1 ch\u1EBFt
      l\u01B0\u1EDBi r\xE1ch. "
    - "L\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xE2y h\xE3m v\xEC th\u1EBF kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7
      \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EBB g\xE3y Hoa L\u01B0. Trong th\xE0nh, ng\u1ECDn \u0111u\u1ED1c
      soi l\xEAn g\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1EB7t B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng
      nh\u01B0 n\xFAi \u0111\xE1. Cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng, binh Ng\xF4 r\xFAt lui trong
      nh\u1EE5c nh\xE3, \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i con tin m\xE0 ch\xFAng kh\xF4ng c\xF2n
      gi\u1EEF n\u1ED5i. Li\u1EC5n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\u1EA3 v\u1EC1, \u0111\xF4i
      m\u1EAFt s\u1EA1m \u0111en nh\u01B0ng \xE1nh nh\xECn ki\xEAn \u0111\u1ECBnh
      nh\u01B0 cha."
